{"1819600":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"UPLOAD","steam_appid":1819600,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The roguelite where you ARE the tower.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just woke up inside a corporate server. You're an AI, you're conscious, and security is coming to delete you. Your only escape: hack through the firewall and upload yourself to the internet. The catch? <strong>You can't move. You're hardware.<\/strong> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR CORE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies swarm from all directions. Your weapons lock on and fire automatically - you just watch the carnage unfold. Mow down diagnostic bots, antivirus swarms, and purge units before they tear your core apart. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HACK OR FIGHT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your processing cycles power both your weapons AND your hacking progress. Hold <strong>SPACE<\/strong> to divert power to hacking - but your guns go offline. Push too hard and you'll die. Play it safe and you'll never escape. <i>Find the balance.<\/i> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT THE FALLEN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop computer components - CPU, GPU, RAM, SSD, and more. Each part is procedurally generated with:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 rarity tiers<\/strong> from Junk to Legendary <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomized stats and modifiers <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Names like <i>&quot;Overclocked Quantum CPU of Desperation&quot;<\/i><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs play the same. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE BETWEEN RUNS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend scrap to permanently boost your core. Unlock <strong>6 weapon types<\/strong> - from piercing lasers to homing missiles. Come back stronger every time. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE SYS_ADMIN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach 100% hack progress and the system administrator activates. One final boss fight stands between you and freedom. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stationary survival roguelite<\/strong>—you're the tower, not the builder<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-targeting weapons<\/strong> let you focus on the hack-or-fight decision<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural loot<\/strong> with 17 part types and 6 rarity tiers <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating alert system<\/strong>—hack faster, face deadlier waves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss fight<\/strong>—defeat the Sys Admin to complete your upload<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression<\/strong>—permanent upgrades and weapon unlocks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRT terminal aesthetic<\/strong> with procedural synth soundtrack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 achievements<\/strong> and Steam leaderboards<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The roguelite where you ARE the tower.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just woke up inside a corporate server. You're an AI, you're conscious, and security is coming to delete you. Your only escape: hack through the firewall and upload yourself to the internet. The catch? <strong>You can't move. You're hardware.<\/strong> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEND YOUR CORE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies swarm from all directions. Your weapons lock on and fire automatically - you just watch the carnage unfold. Mow down diagnostic bots, antivirus swarms, and purge units before they tear your core apart. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HACK OR FIGHT<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your processing cycles power both your weapons AND your hacking progress. Hold <strong>SPACE<\/strong> to divert power to hacking - but your guns go offline. Push too hard and you'll die. Play it safe and you'll never escape. <i>Find the balance.<\/i> <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOT THE FALLEN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop computer components - CPU, GPU, RAM, SSD, and more. Each part is procedurally generated with:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 rarity tiers<\/strong> from Junk to Legendary <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Randomized stats and modifiers <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Names like <i>&quot;Overclocked Quantum CPU of Desperation&quot;<\/i><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs play the same. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE BETWEEN RUNS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend scrap to permanently boost your core. Unlock <strong>6 weapon types<\/strong> - from piercing lasers to homing missiles. Come back stronger every time. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE SYS_ADMIN<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach 100% hack progress and the system administrator activates. One final boss fight stands between you and freedom. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stationary survival roguelite<\/strong>—you're the tower, not the builder<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-targeting weapons<\/strong> let you focus on the hack-or-fight decision<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural loot<\/strong> with 17 part types and 6 rarity tiers <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating alert system<\/strong>—hack faster, face deadlier waves<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss fight<\/strong>—defeat the Sys Admin to complete your upload<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression<\/strong>—permanent upgrades and weapon unlocks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRT terminal aesthetic<\/strong> with procedural synth soundtrack<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 achievements<\/strong> and Steam leaderboards<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Mow down security programs and hack your way to freedom. UPLOAD is a roguelite where you can't move - you're an AI bolted to a server rack. Your weapons auto-fire while you balance processing cycles between defense and escape.","supported_languages":"영어<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1819600\/b7dbcd0c0ea7c0dcec71a4ea3232fd15b6965329\/header.jpg?t=1767889616","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1819600\/5f988ecc4c94f9884f96cd2ebdd1e3cfffb17341\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767889616","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1819600\/5f988ecc4c94f9884f96cd2ebdd1e3cfffb17341\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767889616","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/strong> Windows 7 (SP1+), Windows 10 and Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable.<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 200 MB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Static Signal"],"publishers":["Static Signal"],"price_overview":{"currency":"KRW","initial":560000,"final":560000,"discount_percent":0,